### Justification
Jon Bon Jovi performed three songs at a drive-in rally for Joe Biden in Dallas, Pennsylvania, on October 24, 2020, an event described as having "hundreds of cars" and honking horns [NBC Philadelphia](https://www.nbcphiladelphia.com/news/politics/decision-2020/bon-jovi-plays-at-biden-event-after-candidate-visits-bucks-county/2572756/). No credible news outlet or eyewitness reported an audience of exactly 12 people or the presence of pumpkins; the detail about pumpkins and a tiny audience is absent from all reliable accounts [Associated Press](https://spectrumlocalnews.com/ap-top-news/2020/10/24/the-latest-trump-voting-in-florida-bon-jovi-joining-biden). The claim matches the format of a satirical meme or parody, not a factual report. Therefore, the assertion is **refuted**.